Input: {"question": "Which award did Pello Zabala receive?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 92, "text": "**Breaking News: Renowned Spanish Writer Pello Zabala Honored with Prestigious Light Award**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 94, "end": 274, "text": "In a ceremony held last night in Bilbao, Spain, acclaimed Spanish writer Pello Zabala was awarded the esteemed Light Award, a prestigious recognition in the Basque media landscape."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 275, "end": 410, "text": "This coveted honor is a testament to Zabala's outstanding contributions to literature and his significant impact on the cultural scene."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 411, "end": 586, "text": "The Light Award, established in 2005, is presented annually to individuals who have made remarkable achievements in the fields of literature, journalism, and audiovisual arts."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 587, "end": 721, "text": "This year, the jury unanimously selected Pello Zabala for his remarkable body of work, which has captivated readers and critics alike."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 722, "end": 835, "text": "\"Pello Zabala is a shining example of literary excellence,\" said Amaia Guridi, President of the Light Award Jury."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 836, "end": 955, "text": "\"His writing has not only enriched our cultural heritage but has also inspired a new generation of writers and readers."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 956, "end": 1062, "text": "This award is a well-deserved recognition of his tireless efforts to promote Basque culture and language.\""}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1063, "end": 1193, "text": "Zabala, known for his thought-provoking novels and essays, has been a prominent figure in Spanish literature for over two decades."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1194, "end": 1294, "text": "His works have been translated into multiple languages and have garnered critical acclaim worldwide."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1295, "end": 1500, "text": "According to data from the Spanish Ministry of Culture, Zabala's books have sold over 500,000 copies in the past five years alone, making him one of the most popular and influential writers in the country."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1501, "end": 1596, "text": "\"I am deeply humbled and grateful to receive this award,\" Zabala said in his acceptance speech."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1597, "end": 1753, "text": "\"It is an honor to be recognized by the Basque media community, and I hope this award will inspire others to continue promoting our rich cultural heritage.\""}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1754, "end": 1887, "text": "The Light Award ceremony, attended by prominent figures from the literary and media worlds, was held at the Bilbao Exhibition Centre."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1888, "end": 2057, "text": "The event featured a keynote address by Basque Government's Minister of Culture, Miren Dobaran, who praised Zabala's commitment to promoting Basque language and culture."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2058, "end": 2187, "text": "\"Pello Zabala's work is a testament to the power of literature to bring people together and promote understanding,\" Dobaran said."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2188, "end": 2291, "text": "\"We are proud to recognize his achievements and celebrate his contributions to our cultural landscape.\""}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2292, "end": 2502, "text": "With this prestigious award, Pello Zabala joins an esteemed group of previous winners, including renowned writers, journalists, and artists who have made significant contributions to Basque culture and society."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 87, "text": "**Renowned Spanish Writer Pello Zabala Honored with Prestigious Guggenheim Fellowship**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 89, "end": 360, "text": "Madrid, Spain - In a move that has sent shockwaves of excitement through the literary community, the John Simon Guggenheim Memorial Foundation has announced that acclaimed Spanish writer Pello Zabala is among the recipients of its esteemed Guggenheim Fellowship for 2023."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 361, "end": 569, "text": "The Guggenheim Fellowship, one of the most coveted awards in the arts, is granted annually to a select group of individuals who have demonstrated exceptional talent and achievement in their respective fields."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 570, "end": 708, "text": "This year, Zabala joins an illustrious list of past winners, including Nobel laureates, Pulitzer Prize winners, and other literary giants."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 709, "end": 836, "text": "\"I am truly humbled and grateful to receive this incredible honor,\" Zabala said in an exclusive interview with our publication."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 837, "end": 965, "text": "\"The Guggenheim Fellowship is a beacon of recognition for writers, and to be counted among its recipients is a dream come true.\""}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 966, "end": 1160, "text": "Zabala, 45, has been making waves in the literary world with his poignant and evocative works, which often explore the complexities of human relationships and the nuances of the human condition."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1161, "end": 1344, "text": "His critically acclaimed novel, \"The Whispering Walls,\" has been translated into over 20 languages and has won numerous awards, including the prestigious Premio Nacional de Narrativa."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1345, "end": 1411, "text": "\"Pello's writing is a masterclass in subtlety and depth,\" said Dr."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1412, "end": 1489, "text": "Maria Rodriguez, a literary critic and professor at the University of Madrid."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1490, "end": 1621, "text": "\"He has a unique ability to capture the essence of the human experience, and his work has resonated with readers around the world.\""}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1622, "end": 1810, "text": "The Guggenheim Fellowship will provide Zabala with a generous grant to support his ongoing writing projects, allowing him to focus on his craft without the burden of financial constraints."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1811, "end": 2015, "text": "According to the foundation, the fellowship is designed to \"assist writers, scholars, and artists in their creative endeavors, and to promote a deeper understanding of the humanities and social sciences.\""}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2016, "end": 2095, "text": "\"We are thrilled to welcome Pello Zabala to the Guggenheim community,\" said Dr."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2096, "end": 2170, "text": "Edward Hirsch, president of the John Simon Guggenheim Memorial Foundation."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2171, "end": 2278, "text": "\"His remarkable talent and dedication to his craft make him an ideal candidate for this prestigious award.\""}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2279, "end": 2444, "text": "Zabala's latest novel, \"The Memory of Silence,\" is set to be released in the 